# Password visibility (InPmnt)

Every password input must include a control that reveals the password in plain text.

- Put a **Show** button on the field. After it is used, the label becomes **Hide**.
- The control toggles that field only. Confirm-password fields get their own control.
- The button must not submit the form.
- Keep this on login, sign up, reset password, and any new password field added later.
